name:  Camp Grounds
theme: camp
notes: ~52x52. South = emerge from the (off-map) summoning room into a CAMP (commons + fire pit, dirt ring road, encircling tents); street north to a WIDE sparring arena, all 3 raid entrances on the north wall (forest-clearing lanes); deep forest on top, organic non-overlapping 3x3 trees.
